  "prefLabel": "Cor 101.07 Correctional handbook",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 101.07 “Correctional handbook” means the document furnished to all incarcerated persons under departmental control and which provides information regarding their stay at the prison, including the standards of behavior.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #7446, eff 2-6-01; ss by #12500, eff 3-23-18 (formerly Cor 101.14) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100)",
